Subject: [PATCH 3/4] test(03-39): add failing tests for changing a document
 type

- general to contract_legal reuses the stored parse output (no parser call), general to scanned_image re-parses the stored original once
- version 2 is the only current version, version 1 is superseded and keeps its chunks
- missing original returns original_unavailable and creates no version
- the begin function keeps D-10 for uploads and forces a version only with the flag
- scopeForAdminDocument and the type change refuse other tenants, in both deployment modes
- stubs of changeDocumentType and scopeForAdminDocument keep the failures on assertions

